<title>UK: Alliance to complete LaTex merger by Jan.</title>
<headline>Alliance to complete LaTex merger by Jan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Resources Plc said on Thursday that it expects to complete its merger with LaTex Resources Inc by the end of January 1997.  </p>
<p>The British oil and gas exploration firm announced in August that it was to merge with LaTex, an independent U.S. oil and gas firm from Tulsa, Oklahoma.</p>
<p>Alliance chairman Patrick Maley told the company's annual meeting the cross border nature of the merger involving both UK and U.S. jurisdictions had added to the complexity of finalising the shareholder documentation.</p>
<p>However, the company now expects to send a circular to shareholders in early January.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
